			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"昆钧"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 111210801,
					"content": "小昆，你还在这里找什么呀？线索都查得差不多，该出发啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210802,
					"content": "啊，抱歉，我这是私事，还在找一种名为「镇龙石」的玉石。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210803,
					"content": "「镇龙石」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210804,
						111210805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210804,
					"content": "没听说过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111210806,
					"content": "镇龙石一般用于锻造业，你找这个有什么用？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210807,
					"content": "我…我不知道。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210808,
					"content": "抱歉，我说不清原因…这几天我一直浑浑噩噩，除了名字和家里住址之外，什么都想不起来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210809,
					"content": "说实话，我一直觉得很焦虑，似乎有什么事还没做就被我忘记了。想不起来，好难受…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210810,
					"content": "啊，我懂这种感觉呢！知道自己忘了一件事，却想不起具体是什么事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210811,
					"content": "唉，我也不知道该去哪儿，只好到处乱逛。那天走过集市进去转了转，买东西时听见有人聊天，隐约提到「镇龙石」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210812,
					"content": "这三个字特别耳熟，就好像我要做的事跟那种石头有关系似的…所以，我就想找一块来看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210813,
					"content": "或许把石头拿在手里，就能顺着想起自己要干什么了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210814,
					"content": "原来如此…此行途中若有机会，我也会帮着寻找这种石头。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210815,
					"content": "真的吗？谢谢钟离先生，你真好！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "昆钧"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210816,
					"content": "举手之劳，不足挂齿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210817,
					"content": "要出发了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210818,
					"content": "从层岩巨渊往北，会抵达灵矩关。如果他们选择这条路线，沿途一定会留下痕迹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210819,
					"content": "好，快去看看吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 111210805,
					"content": "是我不了解的东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111210806
